# Resume project

Version-Timestamp: {{ version_timestamp }}

1. Read PROJECT.md, context/INDEX.md and QUALITY.md. Run `python3 -B .starter/project_memory.py resume`.
2. Inspect the returned objective, constraints, decisions, completed work, recorded checks, blockers and next action. A needs_review status requires source reconciliation before action.
3. Inspect actual files, applicable Git status and accessible source dependencies. A clean checkpoint chain does not prove sync, backup, live provider state or source completeness.
4. State what is recovered and what remains unverified. Never replay an external action solely because its outcome is missing; reconcile using an authoritative receipt first.
5. Continue the recorded next action within existing authorization, then checkpoint meaningful progress.

When client_context is needs_review or unavailable, reconcile the selected shared client sources or missing ancestor before dependent work. No source hash is automatically refreshed. A project opened without its client ancestor must state that limitation.
